<title>NETHERLANDS: ROTO SMEETS DE BOER H1 NET PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>ROTO SMEETS DE BOER H1 NET PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>HILVERSUM, Netherlands 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.83 vs   1.82</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.3  vs   4.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			     510.0  vs 450.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    25.4  vs  16.7</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     7.7  vs   9.1</p>
<p>    Tax					6.4  vs   2.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Printer Roto Smeets De Boer NV said in July it saw a</p>
<p>substantially higher 1996 first-half profit.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
